79
00:01:54,553 --> 00:01:55,133
That's a correction.

80
00:01:55,927 --> 00:01:57,867
The S&P 500 isn't there yet.

81
00:01:58,207 --> 00:01:58,767
And the Dow,

82
00:01:58,867 --> 00:02:00,787
which first closed above 50,000 in

83
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:01,147
February,

84
00:02:01,387 --> 00:02:02,607
fell back below it today,

85
00:02:02,407 --> 00:02:03,927
