For the S&P 500 to officially

87
00:02:06,659 --> 00:02:07,759
enter a correction,

88
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:09,319
it would have to close below

89
00:02:09,119 --> 00:02:10,719
about 7,037.

90
00:02:11,179 --> 00:02:13,779
Today it closed at 7,176.

91
00:02:15,417 --> 00:02:16,197
In dollars:

92
00:02:16,337 --> 00:02:18,237
10,000 dollars put into an S&P

93
00:02:18,037 --> 00:02:20,217
500 fund at the October 6

94
00:02:20,017 --> 00:02:22,697
record is worth about 9,178 dollars

95
00:02:22,497 --> 00:02:23,617
today.

96
00:02:24,445 --> 00:02:26,325
But 10,000 dollars put in ten

97
00:02:26,125 --> 00:02:26,865
years ago,

98
00:02:27,085 --> 00:02:28,165
in November 2016,

99
00:02:28,525 --> 00:02:31,605
is worth about 32,888 dollars today,

100
00:02:31,945 --> 00:02:33,085
even after this drop.

101
